From 7989b6ca197ff3cd7b1757385f66da969ab7edd3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chenjinhu <chenjinhu@fumobi.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:28:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Keep regional Accept-Language consistent for all WebView
 requests

Synchronize renderer language preferences and await NetworkContext acknowledgement before resuming navigation. Enforce resolved Accept-Language in both the native request delegate and WebView final header overrides so subresources, fetch, redirects and Workers share the configured regional identity. Native mode preserves existing headers.

Validate real ICU/header formatting, the production WebView override, and 43 native authentication/transport/request-header cases.

